      "message": "VisitDirectDeps can visit all kinds of dependencies, including ones that are not relevant here.  For example, if a host module is built from a source file generated by genrule, then VisitDirectDeps will find the genrule.  You are filtering out unknown module types in createHostModule, but it would be better to use ctx.OtherModuleDependencyTag() (which may not exist yet for SingletonContext, but is being added by aosp/1758349) to filter down to the relevant dependencies first.",
